3. **Both conditions must be met** (`completion_logic: "all"`), ensuring the agent has both navigated to and visually located the pane.

The spawn position is approximately 7-8 blocks from the pane, so the 5-block proximity requirement ensures the agent must actively move toward the building. The facing requirement prevents the agent from accidentally satisfying the milestone by walking near the building without actually looking at the pane.

