- **`facing_tolerance: 60`** — Requires the agent to be looking roughly toward the pane (within 60° of the direction to the target). This prevents accidental completion by walking near the building while facing away.
- **Single rule** — One `position_near_with_facing` rule captures both the navigation and visual identification aspects of a "find" task cleanly and efficiently.

